        "content": "```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Tall Guy and a Grill Catering</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\">\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap');\n        \n        :root {\n            --primary-red: #a63c2e;\n            --dark-red: #8b2f23;\n            --accent-orange: #d97b32;\n            --text-dark: #333333;\n            --text-light: #666666;\n            --bg-light: #fdfdfd;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n            color: var(--text-dark);\n            background-color: var(--bg-light);\n        }\n\n        .font-serif {\n            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n        }\n\n        .brand-red { color: var(--primary-red); }\n        .bg-brand-red { background-color: var(--primary-red); }\n        .bg-brand-orange { background-color: var(--accent-orange); }\n        .border-brand-orange { border-color: var(--accent-orange); }\n        \n        /* Custom Hero Overlay */\n        .hero-overlay {\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.3) 100%);\n        }\n\n        /* Section Divider */\n        .section-divider {\n            height: 1px;\n            background-color: #e5e7eb;\n            width: 100%;\n            margin: 4rem 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Testimonial Box */\n        .testimonial-box {\n            background-color: #943427; /* Slightly darker red for contrast */\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased\">\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"bg-brand-red text-white py-4 px-6 md:px-12 flex justify-between items-center sticky top-0 z-50 shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex space-x-6 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase hidden md:flex\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-200 transition\">About</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-200 transition\">Catering</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-200 transition\">Gallery</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Mobile Menu Icon (visible only on small screens) -->\n        <div class=\"md:hidden text-white cursor-pointer\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-bars text-xl\"></i>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Center Logo -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center leading-none\">\n            <h1 class=\"font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide\">TALL GUY AND A GRILL</h1>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] border-t border-white mt-1 pt-1 px-2\">Catering</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Actions -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4\">\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex space-x-3 text-sm\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:opacity-75\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i></a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:opacity-75\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i></a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:opacity-75\"><i class=\"fab fa-linkedin-in\"></i></a>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"bg-white text-gray-800 px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition\">\n                Reach Out\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <header class=\"relative h-[600px] w-full overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\">\n        <!-- Background Image -->\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544025162-d76694265947?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80\" \n             alt=\"Gourmet Salmon Dish\" \n             class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover\">\n        \n        <!-- Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 hero-overlay\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center mt-20\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-light leading-snug drop-shadow-lg\">\n                We serve the heartfelt flavor and hospitality of Wisconsin<br>\n                with a passion for exceptional experiences.\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pb-20\">\n\n        <!-- Feature Row 1: Locally Sourced (Text Left, Image Right) -->\n        <section class=\"py-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n            <div class=\"order-2 md:order-1 pr-0 md:pr-8\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-brand-red text-2xl font-normal mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide\">Locally Sourced</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                    We source over 50% of our products from Wisconsin supporting our local ecosystem. We celebrate our access to fresh, high-quality ingredients and products, made by our region's farms and producers. From local cheeses to seasonal produce, guests enjoy a taste of Wisconsin with every exceptional bite.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"order-1 md:order-2\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590301157890-4860c56444c3?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80\" \n                     alt=\"Local Jars and Honey\" \n                     class=\"w-full h-auto shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition duration-300\">\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <div class=\"section-divider\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Feature Row 2: Sustainable Catering (Image Left, Text Right) -->\n        <section class=\"py-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n            <div class=\"pl-0 md:pl-8 order-1\">\n                 <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512621776951-a57141f2eefd?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80\" \n                     alt=\"Fresh Salad Plate\" \n                     class=\"w-full h-auto shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition duration-300\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"order-2\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-brand-red text-2xl font-normal mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide\">Sustainable Catering</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                    As well as caring about what comes out of the earth, we care about we put back in it. We're the first and only green caterer in Wisconsin. Our efforts help reduce food and material waste and increase sustainability.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <div class=\"section-divider\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Feature Row 3: Made from Scratch (Text Left, Image Right) -->\n        <section class=\"py-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n            <div class=\"order-2 md:order-1 pr-0 md:pr-8\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-brand-red text-2xl font-normal mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide\">Made from Scratch</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                    We do things from scratch, taking pride in our creations. That includes everything from our seasonal menus with locally sourced ingredients, to made-to-inspire custom plates.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"order-1 md:order-2\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556909114-f6e7ad7d3136?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80\" \n                     alt=\"Chef preparing food\" \n                     class=\"w-full h-auto shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition duration-300\">\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <div class=\"section-divider\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Spacer for visual balance before testimonial -->\n        <div class=\"h-24 md:h-32\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Testimonial Section -->\n        <section class=\"max-w-lg ml-auto mr-0 md:mr-0 lg:mr-[10%]\">\n            <div class=\"testimonial-box p-10 md:p-12 text-white relative\">\n                <p class=\"font-light italic text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                    \"Everything exceeded our expectations! We received so many compliments from our guests. The food and service were truly incredible and helped make our day so memorable for us and our guests. Much love and appreciation to the Tall Guy team!\"\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-medium not-italic\">— Angela G.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Social Feed Placeholder Area -->\n        <section class=\"mt-32 text-center\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-brand-red text-3xl font-light mb-16\">Follow us on social for all the Farm-to-Fork inspiration</h3>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 opacity-50\">\n                <!-- Simulated Video/Post Placeholders -->\n                <div class=\"aspect-video bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center rounded cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-200 transition\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-play text-4xl text-gray-400\"></i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"aspect-video bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center rounded cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-200 transition\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-play text-4xl text-gray-400\"></i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Newsletter / Footer Top -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-brand-orange pt-12 pb-12 px-6\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center\">\n            <p class=\"text-white text-sm mb-8 font-light\">\n                We heard you love food. We have a lot in common. Let's stay in touch.\n            </p>\n            \n            <form class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-stretch max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"First Name\" class=\"flex-1 p-3 rounded text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-900\">\n                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Last Name\" class=\"flex-1 p-3 rounded text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-900\">\n                <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email Address\" class=\"flex-1 p-3 rounded text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-900\">\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"bg-white text-gray-800 px-8 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-gray-100 transition whitespace-nowrap\">\n                    Subscribe\n                </button>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- Footer Bottom -->\n    <div class=\"bg-brand-red py-8 text-center border-t border-red-900\">\n        <p class=\"text-white text-xs opacity-80\">\n            2024 © Tall Guy and a Grill Catering | <a href=\"#\" class=\"underline hover:no-underline\">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href=\"#\" class=\"underline hover:no-underline\">Terms & Conditions</a>\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```",
